      - kind: EndOfLineComment
        text: "'=                                                                                                                   ="
      - kind: Newline
        text: "\r\n"
      - kind: EndOfLineComment
        text: "'= Search functions: Think->SearchRoot->Search->QSearch>Eval"
      - kind: Newline
        text: "\r\n"
      - kind: EndOfLineComment
        text: "'= Think.....: Init search and call \"SearchRoot\" with increasing iterative depth 1,2,3... until time is over"
      - kind: Newline
        text: "\r\n"
      - kind: EndOfLineComment
        text: "'= SearchRoot: create root moves at ply 1 and call \"Search\" starting with ply 2"
      - kind: Newline
        text: "\r\n"
      - kind: EndOfLineComment
        text: "'= Search....: search for best move by recursive calls to itself down to iterative depth or time is over"
      - kind: Newline
        text: "\r\n"
      - kind: EndOfLineComment
        text: "'=             when iterative depth reached, calls QSearch"
      - kind: Newline
        text: "\r\n"
      - kind: EndOfLineComment
        text: "'= QSearch...: quiescence search calculates all captures and checks (first QS-ply only) by recursive calls to itself"
      - kind: Newline
        text: "\r\n"
      - kind: EndOfLineComment
        text: "'=             When all captures are done, the final position evaluation is returned"
      - kind: Newline
        text: "\r\n"
